Looking at this problem, I need to determine the asymptotic magnitude of $\phi(n)$, the maximum number of points selectable from an $n \times n \times n$ grid with no four coplanar.

**Answer-leak check:** The problem statement contains no solutions, answer values, or proof sketches. Proceeding to solve.

